{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026fahTzCRx6B1792753169.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>香港高爾夫球公開賽，港將張雄熙次回合後升上榜首。</p><p></p><p>張雄熙首回合並列第五，這天沒洞超標，捉到六隻低一桿的「小鳥」，包括第五、第12及18洞。</p><p></p><p>另有一個洞造出低兩桿的「老鷹」，以低8桿的62完成，總成績低14桿，在家人觀戰下跳升上榜首，獨自領先美國的蘇拉治3桿。另一港將許龍一，造出低4桿的66，升上並列25，林日曦及黑純一並列50，業餘球手林竑希亦晉級。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_JS.GOLF.HK 1800 + BITE 2000 ANY.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Pv0ZZC0ODe1792763837.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>香港高爾夫球員張雄熙表示︰「感覺棒極了，現場觀眾太讚了，朋友、家人以至素不相識的人支持實在太棒，明顯地我發揮出不錯水平，但比賽才進行一半，希望接下來兩天保持良好狀態，且看結果如何。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T15:40:32.290340+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":268,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T13:57:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T16:18:32.385821+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T15:34:01.483784+00:00","content_hash":"c745957309552db7edc3ed374218bb61a5ee164e32c27a6b73c954927f2d7069","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}